postgres.listen: channel name "nnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnn" is longer than 63 bytes, the longest PostgreSQL keeps
postgres.notify: channel name "nnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnn" is longer than 63 bytes, the longest PostgreSQL keeps
postgres.listen: channel name "éééééééééééééééééééééééééééééééé" is longer than 63 bytes, the longest PostgreSQL keeps
postgres.notify: channel name "éééééééééééééééééééééééééééééééé" is longer than 63 bytes, the longest PostgreSQL keeps
postgres.listen: a channel name cannot be empty
postgres.notify: a channel name cannot be empty
postgres.listen: a channel name cannot hold a NUL character
postgres.notify: a channel name cannot hold a NUL character
